  "invariants": [
    "Recipient-targeted receipt is per-user in_app_notifications; broadcast source rows cannot share read state.",
    "Legacy class_id=0 and a positive course_id means course-wide, not an absent target.",
    "Historical actor and target membership roles must be server-validated; recipient of mentor/faculty can be user UUID.",
    "Scheduled SCHEDULED records must not appear in user inbox until published in a transaction.",
    "A publish event creates one per-user notification receipt using unique(user_id,event_id); duplicate tasks remain idempotent.",
    "A user losing authorization between enqueue and publish must not be notified.",
    "Creator must not supply raw arbitrary recipient identity, external assessment_url, delivery_error or private data.",
    "Campaign state changes and scope/owner changes must be auditable and race safe.",
    "Source-determined times were local datetime; explicit IANA timezone is mandatory at new vNext schedule input.",
    "No original data migration required; all work targets greenfield vNext data."
